      "description": "Narrow assistant and user treatments plus persisted Seen receipt; preview copy is illustrative only.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-messages\"><p class=\"ds-assistant\">What would you like your teammate to help with?</p><p class=\"ds-user\">I’ll describe the role.</p><span class=\"ds-seen\">Seen</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-messages{font-family:var(--font-sans,Arial,sans-serif);font-size:14px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:-.01em;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;max-width:512px;color:var(--foreground,#f2f2f2);} .ds-assistant{align-self:flex-start;max-width:95%;margin:0;border-radius:var(--radius-xl,1.225rem);background:color-mix(in oklch,var(--muted,#2b2b2b) 30%,transparent);padding:8px 12px;} .ds-user{align-self:flex-end;max-width:95%;margin:0;background:var(--secondary,#333333);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:20px 20px 6px 20px;} .ds-seen{align-self:flex-end;padding-right:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:1;color:var(--muted-foreground,#a6a6a6);}"
